import QtQuick
import QtQuick.Shapes

// Mabel TV: Ocean Friends. Original aqua cabinet and charcoal-90s geometry.
// All ten supplied source images are included: nine characters, each once,
// and the seaweed reused twice. The two previous character uploads are included.
// The cabinet, aperture, speaker grilles, MABEL label and controls are unchanged.
// Character artwork is prepared from the supplied pixels, never generated.
// White JPEG backgrounds and stray background fragments are made transparent.
// All prepared images are embedded. No external files are required at runtime.
// Bubbles are native vector paths. The picture aperture remains transparent.
// Align existing picture content to screenRect, or parent it to screenItem.

